{"seq":2,"slug":"models","title":"模型：统计学给序数数据的三套标准答案","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cumulative-link","title":"累积链接模型：比例优势与优势比的干净解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/models/cumulative-link","wordCount":1888,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"threshold-models","title":"阈值模型：一条被切开的潜变量河流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/models/threshold-models","wordCount":1860,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"binary-decomposition","title":"二分分解：把有序问题拆成一串「是否超过」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/models/binary-decomposition","wordCount":1838,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"模型-统计学给序数数据的三套标准答案\">模型：统计学给序数数据的三套标准答案</h1><p>在深度学习接手之前，统计学界已经为序数数据打磨出一套成熟且相互印证的模型。这一章讲三条主干，它们不是三种孤立的技巧，而是从三个角度看同一件事：如何用有限的参数把「有序类别的概率」建出来。</p>\n<p>累积链接模型是主干中的主干。它不直接建每个类别的概率，而是建「不超过某个类别」的累积概率，再套一个链接函数（logit、probit、cloglog）把它拉成线性预测。当所有累积阈值共享同一组回归系数时，就得到最经典的比例优势模型（proportional odds），它的系数有干净的「优势比」解释。阈值模型换了一个讲故事的角度：假想背后有一个连续的潜变量，一组阈值把这条实轴切成若干段，落在哪一段就观测到哪个类别——这套潜变量叙事恰好推导出累积链接的形式，也让「比例优势假设何时被违反」变得直观，并自然引出每个阈值各带斜率的推广。二分分解则走一条工程味更浓的路：把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 类有序问题机械地拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个「是否超过第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 级」的二分类，用任意现成的二分类器求解再拼回来，这也正是后面神经章 CORAL/CORN 的思想源头。</p>\n<p>三篇按「抽象程度递减、工程自由度递增」排列：累积链接是紧致的概率模型，阈值模型给它一个生成式解释并松开假设，二分分解则彻底放开、允许你插入任何分类器。建议顺序阅读，读完你会发现三者在数学上高度相通——理解了这一点，再看 <a href=\"../neural/ordinal-neural\">神经序数回归</a> 就会有「原来只是把线性预测换成了神经网络」的顿悟。本章假设你熟悉逻辑回归与最大似然；若对「有序标签为何不能当普通多分类」还不踏实，请先回到 <a href=\"../foundations/\">基础</a> 章。</p>\n"}